# url-roundtrip (h2-input): open on center=1.5,-2&scale=2, pan 50 px right,
# hold still past the flick window, release, settle. Behaviour: the URL keeps
# scale=2 with the panned center (at scale 2 a unit is 12.5 px wide: 50 px
# moves 4 units, no glide after the hold).
query center=1.5,-2&scale=2
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 928 490
down
move 978 490 over 80
wait 300
up
wait 1500
shot url-roundtrip
